msgid "So we focused on one product and set out to do it properly — the <strong style=\"color:var(--black)\">WaRa FT-SCL029</strong> keypad lock. It brings code-based, keyless security to the furniture people use every day, at a price that makes sense for homes as well as hotels, offices and gyms."
